OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 18 APR
OL,4,G0800FDermot O'Leary
OL,5,     GBlur's Alex James chats about the
OL,6,     Gnew Record Store Day vinyl
OL,7,     Greleases - and plans for this
OL,8,     Gyear's Big Feastival. Plus a
OL,9,     Gwedding call and The Mystery
OL,10,     GVoice.
OL,11,G1000FRomesh Ranganathan
OL,12,     GActor Martin Clunes joins Romesh
OL,13,     Glive in the studio to chat about
OL,14,     Ghis book 'Training John and
OL,15,     GMurray'.
OL,16,G1300FEmma Willis
OL,17,     GSpend Saturday lunchtime with
OL,18,     GEmma and enjoy a menu full of
OL,19,     Gyour favourite music, great
OL,20,     Gconversation and a delicious dive
OL,21,     Ginto the BBC archives for dessert.
